INSERT INTO player_matches VALUES(555,2,14025210,14,NULL,'2025-26','2025-12-14','West Ham United','A','PL',90,6.5,1,'RB','pivot-right',1,'4-2-3-1',43.89999999999999858,18.80000000000000071,59.5,75,'1,0,0,1,0,0,0,2,5,9,0,0,2,10,16,0,0,0,3,15,0,0,0,3,8','10010001360016X0002900025',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'(match heatmap analysis)','QUALITATIVE READ. More reserved than Maatsen. Supported Villa''s right-sided play behind/around McGinn but sat comparatively deeper, giving a slightly asymmetric fullback picture (Maatsen high-left, Cash a touch more measured on the right) to help screen against Summerville/Diouf and balance the counter. Hot zone: right flank, middle third. MOVEMENT: selective overlaps on the right rather than the sustained high positioning of Maatsen; contributed to the back-three-ish rest defence when Villa built.','SofaScore API /event/14025210/lineups players[] 배열순서 + /average-positions (2026-07-31)','HIGH on minutes/rating/avg coords (API). lineup_order는 라인업 배열 인덱스 = 원천값이고 좌표 역산이 아니다. lineup_pos는 (formation, order) 파생 — 실측 y 레인과 대조 검증됨. pos_class는 minutes<45일 때 NULL(좌표 평균 신뢰불가).');
INSERT INTO player_matches VALUES(556,16,14025210,14,NULL,'2025-26','2025-12-14','West Ham United','A','PL',75,6.400000000000000355,1,'ST','CAM',10,'4-2-3-1',64.59999999999999431,49.89999999999999858,59.5,21,'0,0,3,1,2,0,2,2,2,1,2,0,0,1,1,1,2,0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0','00X3707773700333703000000',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'(match heatmap analysis)','QUALITATIVE READ. Highest and most central average position of any Villa player, pinned to the West Ham centre-backs (Mavropanos/Todibo) around the top of the box and penalty spot. Hot zone is central, in and around the D. MOVEMENT: classic centre-forward occupation — cross-and-near-post runs plus dropping to link. His run across Mavropanos on McGinn''s 9th-min cross forced the own goal (he made the run without being credited). Tightly marked early so touches were limited; a fixed reference point stretching the WH line rather than a wide/roaming forward. Off at 75'' for Buendía with Villa in control.','SofaScore API /event/14025210/lineups players[] 배열순서 + /average-positions (2026-07-31)','HIGH on minutes/rating/avg coords (API). lineup_order는 라인업 배열 인덱스 = 원천값이고 좌표 역산이 아니다. lineup_pos는 (formation, order) 파생 — 실측 y 레인과 대조 검증됨. pos_class는 minutes<45일 때 NULL(좌표 평균 신뢰불가).');
