INSERT INTO player_matches VALUES(881,1,NULL,29,NULL,'2025-26','2026-02-07','Bournemouth',NULL,NULL,90,8.699999999999999289,NULL,NULL,'GK',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0000000000000000020001X10',NULL,0.0,NULL,2,NULL,0,0,0,0,63,NULL,'{"xa": 0, "passes_total": 44, "passes_acc": 27, "touches": 63, "duels_won": 2, "aerials_won": 1, "assists": 0, "interceptions": 0, "tackles": 0}','Sweeper-keeper / last line — kept Villa level under sustained pressure (Bournemouth 20 shots, xG ~2.31 vs Villa 0.44). 7 saves (4 first-half, 3 second-half), 4 of them from inside the box; twice denied Ryan Christie late. 1.14 goals prevented, 1 punch, 3 high claims, 2 keeper-sweeper runs (1 successful). His single highest-rated match of the season and effectively man of the match.','Densest in the 6-yard box and along the goal-line, centred; secondary warmth across the full width of the penalty area (both posts) and a thin trail to the edge of the box. / Avg position pinned to his own goal-line, dead-centre laterally (SofaScore heat centroid ~x10.1/y50.9 on a 0-100 pitch). Busy, wide-covering shift: 74 heat points spread near-post to far-post (y range ~9-73) with forward activity out to the edge of the box (x range 0-41) for shot-blocking and distribution.','https://www.sofascore.com/football/player/emiliano-martinez/158263 ; heat_map25 grid from SofaScore API heatmap points (5x5 tool-space, 2026-07-02) ; event stats via SofaScore API statistics (2026-07-02)','High. All three ratings, results, venues, minutes, positions, and per-match stats come directly from SofaScore''s own API');
INSERT INTO player_matches VALUES(882,1,NULL,18,NULL,'2025-26','2026-01-25','Newcastle United',NULL,NULL,90,8.199999999999999289,NULL,NULL,'GK',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0000000000000000110001X00',NULL,0.0100000000000000002,NULL,3,NULL,0,0,0,0,63,NULL,'{"xa": 0.01, "passes_total": 48, "passes_acc": 18, "touches": 63, "duels_won": 3, "aerials_won": 1, "assists": 0, "interceptions": 0, "tackles": 0}','Sweeper-keeper anchoring a clean sheet in Villa''s first win at St James'' Park since 2005. 4 saves (all 4 from inside the box), including two crucial first-half stops from Sandro Tonali (a ~35-second ''wonder'' effort) and Lewis Miley. Highest goals-prevented of the three matches (1.31). Handled crosses aggressively — 6 high claims — and hit 39 long balls as the primary out-ball.','Hottest along the goal-line and central 6-yard box, leaning slightly to one side of goal; broad but shallow coverage across the penalty-area width (y ~31-76), little activity beyond the box. / Avg position on his own goal-line with a slight right-of-centre bias (heat centroid ~x10.4/y53.2). Most home-bound of the three (forward x range only 1-34): stayed on his line, minimal sweeping, one keeper-sweeper run. 77 heat points concentrated goal-side.','https://www.sofascore.com/football/player/emiliano-martinez/158263 ; heat_map25 grid from SofaScore API heatmap points (5x5 tool-space, 2026-07-02) ; event stats via SofaScore API statistics (2026-07-02)','High. All three ratings, results, venues, minutes, positions, and per-match stats come directly from SofaScore''s own API');
INSERT INTO player_matches VALUES(883,1,NULL,7,NULL,'2025-26','2025-11-09','Bournemouth',NULL,NULL,90,8.199999999999999289,NULL,NULL,'GK',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0000000000000000010000X20',NULL,0.0,NULL,0,NULL,0,0,0,0,51,NULL,'{"xa": 0, "passes_total": 40, "passes_acc": 26, "touches": 51, "assists": 0, "interceptions": 0, "tackles": 0, "duels_won": 0}','Sweeper-keeper in a dominant home win; clean sheet headlined by a one-handed penalty save from Antoine Semenyo (awarded for a Morgan Rogers handball). 3 saves (1 from inside the box) plus the spot-kick stop, 1.06 goals prevented, 2 high claims, 1 keeper-sweeper run. Comfortable on the ball in a controlled 4-0 (Buendía free-kick, Onana, Barkley, Malen).','Hottest on the goal-line and penalty-spot area (penalty-save moment), centre-left; lateral coverage y ~14-61, plus the deepest forward reach of the three into the penalty-arc zone. / Avg position on his own goal-line, marginally left-of-centre (heat centroid ~x10.5/y46.4). Came off his line furthest of the three (forward x range 0-46 — out toward the penalty spot/edge of box for the penalty save and sweeping). 63 heat points, the lowest volume, reflecting a quieter, control-oriented shift.','https://www.sofascore.com/football/player/emiliano-martinez/158263 ; heat_map25 grid from SofaScore API heatmap points (5x5 tool-space, 2026-07-02) ; event stats via SofaScore API statistics (2026-07-02)','High. All three ratings, results, venues, minutes, positions, and per-match stats come directly from SofaScore''s own API');
INSERT INTO player_matches VALUES(884,4,NULL,1,NULL,'2025-26','2025-09-25','Bologna',NULL,NULL,90,7.900000000000000355,NULL,NULL,'LCB (left centre-back in a 4-2-3-1 back four)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0010001100331005X12083811',NULL,0.0100000000000000002,NULL,8,4,2,1,0,0,70,NULL,'{"xa": 0.01, "passes_total": 55, "passes_acc": 52, "touches": 70, "duels_won": 8, "duels_lost": 4, "tackles": 2, "interceptions": 1, "dribbles_won": 2, "aerials_won": 4, "assists": 0}','Deep, defensive-anchor ball-playing centre-back. Sat very deep to protect a narrow 1-0 lead (McGinn scored; Villa''s first home goal of the season). Left-sided CB next to Konsa; job was containment and clean-sheet management rather than progression.','Own defensive third, left-centre channel (LCB zone), hugging the edge of his own penalty area; touch spread x 4-91, y 10-97 but heavily clustered deep-left. / Very deep average position: SofaScore avg coords x=26.1, y=69.1 (x: 0=own goal, 100=opp goal, so ~own third; y=69 = left-of-centre). ~70% of his 90 touch-points fell in his own third, only 3% in the attacking third. Movement was compact, mostly own-third left/left-centre channel with occasional step into the centre-half-space.','https://www.sofascore.com/football/match/aston-villa-bologna/PsKdb#id:14572679 ; heat_map25 grid from SofaScore API heatmap points (5x5 tool-space, 2026-07-02) ; event stats via SofaScore API statistics (2026-07-02)','HIGH on ratings, positions, and match facts; MEDIUM-QUALITATIVE on heatmaps. Ratings are pulled directly from SofaScore''');
INSERT INTO player_matches VALUES(885,4,NULL,34,NULL,'2025-26','2026-04-25','Fulham',NULL,NULL,90,7.599999999999999645,NULL,NULL,'LCB (left centre-back in a 4-2-3-1 back four)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'00010130004X2006852043410',NULL,0.02000000000000000041,NULL,4,5,1,0,0,0,88,NULL,'{"xa": 0.02, "passes_total": 81, "passes_acc": 69, "touches": 88, "duels_won": 4, "duels_lost": 5, "tackles": 1, "dribbles_won": 1, "aerials_won": 2, "assists": 0, "interceptions": 0}','Ball-playing left centre-back / build-up initiator. Despite the defeat (Sessegnon 43''), earned his 2nd-highest rating of the season through progression and defensive reading: 88 touches, 81 passes (85.2% acc), a season-high 14 attempted long balls, 2 blocks and a last-man tackle. Stepped noticeably higher into midfield to build.','Left half-space spanning own third into the middle third; wide-left build-up positions and central circulation. Touch spread x 4-89, y 31-96. / Higher, more involved average position than Bologna: SofaScore avg coords x=35.3, y=70.5. Touch distribution split roughly own third 44% / middle third 54% / attacking third 2%, he pushed up into the middle third to receive and progress. Left-centre channel dominant (y clustered high = left side).','https://www.sofascore.com/football/match/fulham-aston-villa/PsT#id:14024004 ; heat_map25 grid from SofaScore API heatmap points (5x5 tool-space, 2026-07-02) ; event stats via SofaScore API statistics (2026-07-02)','HIGH on ratings, positions, and match facts; MEDIUM-QUALITATIVE on heatmaps. Ratings are pulled directly from SofaScore''');
INSERT INTO player_matches VALUES(886,4,NULL,35,NULL,'2025-26','2026-05-07','Nottingham Forest',NULL,NULL,89,7.5,NULL,NULL,'LCB (left centre-back in a 4-2-3-1 back four)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'00320200004X1002880063330',0.2999999999999999889,0.0100000000000000002,NULL,6,2,1,1,0,0,51,NULL,'{"xg": 0.3, "xa": 0.01, "passes_total": 40, "passes_acc": 34, "touches": 51, "duels_won": 6, "duels_lost": 2, "tackles": 1, "interceptions": 1, "shots_on": 1, "aerials_won": 3, "assists": 0}','Ball-playing left centre-back in a dominant, front-foot performance that sent Villa to the Europa League final. Won the penalty for Villa''s 2nd goal (fouled by Milenkovic, VAR-reviewed, converted by Buendia 58''); also forced an early save with a header. Comfortable defensively in a clean sheet: 6 duels won, 3 aerials won, 85% passing on 40 passes. Subbed off 89'' with the tie won.','Left-centre channel from own half stepping into midfield; occasional forays into the left of the opposition box (set pieces / the won penalty). Touch spread x 6-97, y 27-97. / Attacking-minded average position for a CB: SofaScore avg coords x=37.4, y=66.7 (deeper-left but stepping up as Villa pinned Forest back). Verified as LCB by the full back-four spread that night: Cash RB y=15, Konsa RCB y=32, Torres y=67, Digne LB y=90. Touch spread reached x=97 (into the Forest box for his header/penalty-win) though the bulk stayed left-of-centre in Villa''s half.','https://www.sofascore.com/football/match/aston-villa-nottingham-forest/osP#id:15632625 ; heat_map25 grid from SofaScore API heatmap points (5x5 tool-space, 2026-07-02) ; event stats via SofaScore API statistics (2026-07-02)','HIGH on ratings, positions, and match facts; MEDIUM-QUALITATIVE on heatmaps. Ratings are pulled directly from SofaScore''');
INSERT INTO player_matches VALUES(887,15,NULL,21,NULL,'2025-26','2026-03-19','Lille',NULL,NULL,84,7.5,NULL,NULL,'RW (right wing, inverted)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'510540025X000061024601010',0.3300000000000000155,0.2399999999999999912,2,4,4,1,1,0,1,48,NULL,'{"xg": 0.33, "xa": 0.24, "key_passes": 2, "passes_total": 26, "passes_acc": 22, "touches": 48, "duels_won": 4, "duels_lost": 4, "tackles": 1, "interceptions": 1, "shots_off": 1, "dribbles_won": 1, "aerials_won": 1, "assists": 1}','Inverted right winger drifting infield; provided width in build-up then cut central to create. Assisted John McGinn''s opener (latched onto an Emi Martinez long ball, drove into the box dragging defenders wide, cut it back for McGinn). Also hit the woodwork late. Widely called his best display in a Villa shirt (McGinn: MOTM ''by a mile''); OneFootball 7.5.','Densest cluster in the attacking third on the right flank (x 70-95, right channel), secondary cluster centrally in the middle third as he cut infield; touches spanned full pitch width (y 0-100), reaching the byline (x max 95). / Average position advanced and right-sided, approx x 62 / y 28 (opponent half, right channel). Heaviest touches in the attacking third; active 84 minutes with high ball-carrying volume (24 carries, 7 progressive).','https://api.sofascore.com/api/v1/event/15631843/player/851100/statistics ; heat_map25 grid from SofaScore API heatmap points (5x5 tool-space, 2026-07-02) ; event stats via SofaScore API statistics (2026-07-02)','MEDIUM-HIGH on the identity of the top-3 matches and the SofaScore ratings; MEDIUM on heatmap specifics. Ratings are pul');
INSERT INTO player_matches VALUES(888,15,NULL,17,NULL,'2025-26','2026-01-22','Fenerbahce',NULL,NULL,75,7.400000000000000355,NULL,NULL,'RW (right wing, inverted)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'005242012X012430134100133',1.060000000000000053,0.3800000000000000044,NULL,5,5,3,0,1,0,43,NULL,'{"xg": 1.06, "xa": 0.38, "passes_total": 24, "passes_acc": 13, "touches": 43, "duels_won": 5, "duels_lost": 5, "tackles": 3, "shots_on": 2, "dribbles_won": 2, "goals": 1, "assists": 0, "interceptions": 0}','Wide forward on the right who got into central goal-scoring positions. Scored the only goal — a 25th-minute header at the near/six-yard area from Matty Cash''s deflected cross — his first Villa goal, sealing last-16 progression. Named Flashscore Man of the Match. Wasteful otherwise (2 big chances missed, 4 shots, xG 1.06); subbed off 75''.','Hottest zone right flank in the attacking third right up to the byline (x 86-98); secondary central cluster in the middle third; a deeper cluster in his own half showing defensive contribution. Wide x-span (4-98). / Average position around x 55 / y 31 (halfway line, right-of-centre). Asymmetric: advanced right-flank presence in attack (x 86-98) plus deeper defensive tracking, some of it toward the left, reflecting his off-ball work.','https://api.sofascore.com/api/v1/event/14572701/player/851100/statistics ; heat_map25 grid from SofaScore API heatmap points (5x5 tool-space, 2026-07-02) ; event stats via SofaScore API statistics (2026-07-02)','MEDIUM-HIGH on the identity of the top-3 matches and the SofaScore ratings; MEDIUM on heatmap specifics. Ratings are pul');
INSERT INTO player_matches VALUES(889,15,NULL,22,NULL,'2025-26','2026-03-22','West Ham United',NULL,NULL,67,7.099999999999999645,NULL,NULL,'RW (right wing, inverted)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'011453133X000020002000010',0.0100000000000000002,0.2800000000000000267,3,1,3,0,0,0,1,34,NULL,'{"xg": 0.01, "xa": 0.28, "key_passes": 3, "passes_total": 26, "passes_acc": 22, "touches": 34, "duels_won": 1, "duels_lost": 3, "dribbles_won": 1, "assists": 1, "interceptions": 0, "tackles": 0}','Right winger; 1 assist and 1 big chance created (3 key passes), 22/26 passes with 21 accurate in the opposition half — a high-quality creative outing feeding John McGinn / Ollie Watkins in Villa''s 2-0 win. Subbed at 67''. SofaScore 7.1 (alt fluid rating 7.3); FotMob 7.7 (his top FotMob score of the season), WhoScored 7.11.','Primary hot zone attacking third, central-to-right (x 75-95, y 0-35) close to the opponent goal; secondary central middle-third cluster (x 60-75); only token defensive-third touches. Reached the byline (x max 99). / Most advanced average position of the three, approx x 74 / y 27 — pinned high and right in the opposition half. Touches concentrated near the opponent box; limited defensive involvement.','https://api.sofascore.com/api/v1/event/14024014/player/851100/statistics ; heat_map25 grid from SofaScore API heatmap points (5x5 tool-space, 2026-07-02) ; event stats via SofaScore API statistics (2026-07-02)','MEDIUM-HIGH on the identity of the top-3 matches and the SofaScore ratings; MEDIUM on heatmap specifics. Ratings are pul');
INSERT INTO player_matches VALUES(890,4,NULL,11,NULL,'2025-26','2025-12-03','Brighton & Hove Albion',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Left centre-back',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,6,NULL,3,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{"interceptions": 0, "tackles": 3, "duels_won": 6}','(match heatmap analysis)','This match: left-central defensive third; poor first half — ''calamitous'' own goal (29'') amid early chaos, settled later but rated worst (~4.5). Footprint left-central, slightly higher when building from the back. Confidence: MEDIUM.','rogers-cam-analysis','MEDIUM overall. Confirmed with high confidence: the 4-2-3-1 lineup and each player''s nominal position (FotMob + Sky Spor');
INSERT INTO player_matches VALUES(891,7,NULL,44,NULL,'2025-26','2026-01-07','Crystal Palace',NULL,NULL,90,7.5,NULL,NULL,'Left centre-back',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0000000000022000X10005100',0.02999999999999999889,0.0,1,1,NULL,0,0,0,0,95,NULL,'{"xg": 0.03, "xa": 0, "key_passes": 1, "passes_total": 88, "passes_acc": 88, "touches": 95, "duels_won": 1, "shots_off": 1, "aerials_won": 1, "assists": 0, "interceptions": 0, "tackles": 0}','Left-sided CB in a 4-2-3-1 back four, partnering Ezri Konsa (right CB). Ball-playing, build-up-oriented role: primary left-side progressor and press-resistant distributor while keeping a clean sheet on the road.','Hot zones concentrated in Villa''s LEFT-half defensive third and left half-space, pushing into midfield when Villa had the ball. SofaScore heatmap centroid ~x28.5 (own-half, ~28% up the pitch) / y65 (left-of-centre); his average position (x29.0, y65.5) sat clearly LEFT of partner Konsa (y35.4), with LB Digne/Maatsen wider still (y80-87) — confirming the left-CB read. Movement footprint stretched from deep (x4) up to x89, showing repeated stepping-into-midfield carries (24 ball carries, ~161m) as the left-side build-up outlet rather than a touchline-hugging role. / Dominant, calm, entirely-in-control display and his clear season peak. Perfect distribution: SofaScore logged 88/88 passes (100%) with 95 touches, plus 1 key pass and 1 big chance created (a late headed chance that hit the post). Defensively tidy with 3 clearances, 1 block, 2 recoveries. The Premier League match report independently flagged his 100% passing as the best full-90 100%-accuracy figure in the PL since Aymeric Laporte in Feb 2022 (report cites 85 completed; SofaScore''s tracking logged 88 — minor provider difference, both agree it was flawless).','https://www.sofascore.com/football/match/aston-villa-crystal-palace/hP#id:14025058 ; heat_map25 grid from SofaScore API heatmap points (5x5 tool-space, 2026-07-02) ; event stats via SofaScore API statistics (2026-07-02)','Villa-only 2025/26, starts with 30+ min (n=21, SofaScore): as LCB ~6.65 avg over 12 apps; as RCB ~6.66 avg over 9 apps — essentially identical either side. His two-best matches came on opposite sides ');
INSERT INTO player_matches VALUES(892,7,NULL,21,NULL,'2025-26','2026-03-19','Lille',NULL,NULL,90,7.099999999999999645,NULL,NULL,'Right centre-back',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'001100000100660019X100131',NULL,0.0100000000000000002,NULL,1,NULL,0,0,0,0,63,NULL,'{"xa": 0.01, "passes_total": 61, "passes_acc": 59, "touches": 63, "duels_won": 1, "aerials_won": 1, "assists": 0, "interceptions": 0, "tackles": 0}','Right-sided CB in a 4-2-3-1 back four, partnering Pau Torres (left CB). Progressive, carry-heavy role in a controlled home knockout win — Emery''s own summary was ''controlled rather than spectacular''.','Hot zones in Villa''s RIGHT-of-centre half, extending well into the middle third as Villa dominated. Heatmap centroid ~x37.6 (higher up than the Palace game, reflecting Villa''s control) / y37.1 (right-of-centre); average position (x38.1, y37.6) sat RIGHT of partner Pau Torres (y73.9), with RB Cash tighter to the touchline (y11.5). Movement footprint spanned x3 to x83 — repeated forward carries out of defence into the right half-space rather than deep defending. / Comfortable, front-foot performance managing a first-leg lead. Very progressive on the ball: a team-high-type 43 ball carries covering ~379m, with 59/61 passes completed (97%). Low defensive workload against a passive Lille (1 clearance, 2 recoveries, 1 aerial won, 1 duel won) — the rating reflects composed possession and territory rather than firefighting. Tie-break note: this and the Fenerbahçe match are both exactly 7.1/90 min; ranked #2 here only by recency/slightly higher on-ball volume — treat #2 and #3 as effectively co-equal.','https://www.sofascore.com/football/match/lille-aston-villa/PsTH#id:15631843 ; heat_map25 grid from SofaScore API heatmap points (5x5 tool-space, 2026-07-02) ; event stats via SofaScore API statistics (2026-07-02)','Villa-only 2025/26, starts with 30+ min (n=21, SofaScore): as LCB ~6.65 avg over 12 apps; as RCB ~6.66 avg over 9 apps — essentially identical either side. His two-best matches came on opposite sides ');
INSERT INTO player_matches VALUES(893,7,NULL,17,NULL,'2025-26','2026-01-22','Fenerbahce',NULL,NULL,90,7.099999999999999645,NULL,NULL,'Right centre-back',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0100000210002220046100X52',NULL,0.1499999999999999945,NULL,2,1,0,0,0,0,38,NULL,'{"xa": 0.15, "passes_total": 26, "passes_acc": 21, "touches": 38, "duels_won": 2, "duels_lost": 1, "aerials_won": 2, "assists": 0, "interceptions": 0, "tackles": 0}','Right-sided CB in a 4-2-3-1 back four, partnering Tyrone Mings (left CB). Deep, defence-first rearguard role protecting a slender away lead — a ''backs-to-the-wall'' night (deputy keeper Bizot made 8 saves).','Hot zones packed into Villa''s RIGHT-side defensive third and central penalty-area edge — a low, compact block. Heatmap centroid ~x27.4 (deep, own third) / y37.8 (right-of-centre); average position (x27.9, y38.2) sat RIGHT of partner Tyrone Mings (y59.9), with RB Cash outside him (y13.7). Movement footprint was the most compressed of the three (spanning to x87 only on rare clearances/outlets), consistent with a defend-the-lead brief and little forward stepping. / Resolute defensive display, stylistically the opposite of the Palace and Lille games. Heavy clearing workload: 10 clearances (his season high in these matches), 4 recoveries, 2 aerials won, 2 duels won. Minimal on-ball involvement by choice — just 38 touches, 21/26 passes, 6 carries (~49m) — as Villa sat deep and soaked pressure. The 7.1 rewards defensive volume and clean-sheet contribution rather than distribution.','https://www.sofascore.com/football/match/fenerbahce-aston-villa/Psclb#id:14572701 ; heat_map25 grid from SofaScore API heatmap points (5x5 tool-space, 2026-07-02) ; event stats via SofaScore API statistics (2026-07-02)','Villa-only 2025/26, starts with 30+ min (n=21, SofaScore): as LCB ~6.65 avg over 12 apps; as RCB ~6.66 avg over 9 apps — essentially identical either side. His two-best matches came on opposite sides ');
